{
  "intended_outcome": "Test-run design.md item #7 chained-plan: register 4 archetype gameplay tags, author shared S_EnemyArchetype tuning struct, and create 4 per-archetype aggression-vs-distance curves with distinct shapes. Validates plan-validator + executor on a multi-module plan (gameplay_tags + uds + curves) crossing the .ini-config boundary plus the /Game/.uasset boundary.",
  "risk_level": "high",
  "operations": [
